    {
      "start": 3.675,
      "end": 11.98,
      "text": "Units first: metres, on a quarter metre grid.",
      "reading_seconds": 4.11,
      "voice": "5425951febbfe55b"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.03,
      "end": 18.17,
      "text": "Ok! Repeating parts is where modeling gets quick. Let's build a pavilion.",
      "reading_seconds": 6.19,
      "voice": "86af60ac01a99d27"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.22,
      "end": 27.475,
      "text": "One column first. Circle: click the centre, then a grid point on the edge.",
      "reading_seconds": 6.19,
      "voice": "8a0c69c9bfffe19b"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.525,
      "end": 42.475,
      "text": "Press T on the edge for a helper, then Push/Pull three metres up it.",
      "reading_seconds": 5.95,
      "voice": "305b7b385e2ca303"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.464,
      "end": 60.278,
      "text": "Good. Make it an object. That's what the copies will share.",
      "reading_seconds": 5.87,
      "voice": "b6f9075e7e1ce263"
    },
    {
      "start": 60.328,
      "end": 68.547,
      "text": "Rotate Copy spins copies around a centre. Select the column first.",
      "reading_seconds": 7.31,
      "voice": "651f37a485d00cac"
    },
    {
      "start": 68.597,
      "end": 74.731,
      "text": "Pick the centre of the circle, on the grid, then the edge of the column.",
      "reading_seconds": 6.03,
      "voice": "5e02adcf424194b0"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.781,
      "end": 82.681,
      "text": "Aim roughly around, then type an angle and a count: 30 x11 adds eleven.",
      "reading_seconds": 7.95,
      "voice": "d441a42abbf6d9dc"
    },
    {
      "start": 82.731,
      "end": 87.352,
      "text": "Wooooow! Twelve columns from one.",
      "reading_seconds": 4.67,
      "voice": "e1a75338d3dbffba"
    },
    {
      "start": 87.402,
      "end": 98.017,
      "text": "Now the floor: a big circle around them, on the same centre.",
      "reading_seconds": 5.71,
      "voice": "c1b80c300bb82c5b"
    },
    {
      "start": 98.067,
      "end": 113.583,
      "text": "Same again: a helper on its edge, Push/Pull up one grid step.",
      "reading_seconds": 7.63,
      "voice": "3dddd1a44f1fcf79"
    },
    {
      "start": 113.633,
      "end": 119.501,
      "text": "Make it an object too.",
      "reading_seconds": 2.6,
      "voice": "7eb80a215aa4cc87"
    },
    {
      "start": 119.551,
      "end": 134.815,
      "text": "The roof is just the floor again. Move Copy it, up that same helper.",
      "reading_seconds": 7.55,
      "voice": "a414a3c633651d46"
    },
    {
      "start": 134.865,
      "end": 141.609,
      "text": "Awesome. Clear Guides, and take a look around.",
      "reading_seconds": 4.03,
      "voice": "d7dd84a078b67618"
    },
    {
      "start": 141.659,
      "end": 149.795,
      "text": "Change that one column's definition later, and all twelve update together.",
      "reading_seconds": 5.686,
      "voice": "2578473d2c56a8c4"
    }
  ]
